Package: securebench
Title: Security Benchmark Datasets and Harnesses for Large Language
    Model Agents
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R:
    person("Ian", "Flores Siaca", , "iflores.siaca@hey.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Security-specific benchmark datasets and evaluation harnesses
    for Large Language Model (LLM) agents in R. Measure prompt-injection
    resistance, dangerous-code detection, and leakage of personally
    identifiable information or secrets against labeled datasets; compute
    precision, recall, and F1 metrics; generate confusion matrices; and run
    A/B comparisons of guardrail configurations (for example, 'secureguard'
    pipelines). Designed to complement the general-purpose 'vitals'
    evaluation framework: guardrails export as 'vitals'-compatible scorers.
